WEBVTT

00:00.049 --> 00:04.970
This is a work of fiction.
Underage drinking is strongly prohibited and illegal.
Scenes involving alcohol with forceful consumption and shameful acts are not encouraged. Please view this as a comedy. Furthermore, all characters appearing in this work are of legal age.

00:07.598 --> 00:09.433
This is bad...

00:09.850 --> 00:12.478
You're the only one who's going to fail.

00:13.145 --> 00:15.481
No way. I'm the only one who's going to fail?

00:15.648 --> 00:18.234
If they find out...

00:18.400 --> 00:21.445
I'll die of embarrassment!

00:21.946 --> 00:25.574
You're not good at mask clearing.

00:26.033 --> 00:28.369
Luckily, I have a mask.

00:28.535 --> 00:30.871
And there's a pool and the ocean nearby.

00:31.038 --> 00:34.875
The only problem is how to practice
without those guys finding out.

00:35.042 --> 00:37.044
I can't get them drunk or lock them up.

00:37.211 --> 00:39.547
-Iori?
-I can knock them out.

00:39.713 --> 00:41.882
But it's dinner time now.

00:42.049 --> 00:43.592
Maybe I could poison them!

00:43.759 --> 00:45.344
What are you smiling about?

00:45.511 --> 00:48.430
Chisa! It's not nice to eavesdrop!

00:48.597 --> 00:50.891
Not as bad as poisoning people.

00:51.058 --> 00:53.519
Hey! We're going to go rent a car.

00:53.686 --> 00:55.396
We're going to the market.

00:55.604 --> 00:58.607
Hey, Chisa! They're calling you.

01:00.192 --> 01:01.860
He's acting suspicious.

01:03.028 --> 01:06.782
Be passionate, my friends

01:06.991 --> 01:10.035
Shine bright with the sun

01:10.202 --> 01:13.580
Dive into the blue sky

01:13.789 --> 01:17.501
And let summer take it all

01:21.505 --> 01:24.508
GRAND BLUE DREAMING

01:31.682 --> 01:35.519
Be passionate, my friends

01:35.686 --> 01:38.772
Shine bright with the sun

01:38.939 --> 01:42.067
Dive into the blue sky

01:42.276 --> 01:46.322
And let summer take it all

01:46.488 --> 01:49.325
An expanding ocean of possibilities

01:49.491 --> 01:53.370
Summer is our amore

01:53.537 --> 01:57.041
We'll swear to the crystal clear sky

01:57.207 --> 02:00.169
Summer is in our hands

02:00.336 --> 02:04.256
Be passionate, my friends

02:04.423 --> 02:07.426
Shine bright with the sun

02:07.593 --> 02:10.888
Dive into the blue sky

02:11.096 --> 02:14.516
And let summer take it all

02:14.683 --> 02:18.687
With a cheerful heart

02:18.854 --> 02:21.690
Don't mess with me

02:21.857 --> 02:25.444
Keep going even if you fall

02:25.652 --> 02:29.073
And let summer take it all

02:33.327 --> 02:35.454
All right. Use this.

02:38.624 --> 02:40.250
What's wrong?

02:40.417 --> 02:42.336
What does it look like?

02:42.503 --> 02:44.838
How are we all supposed to fit in this?

02:45.005 --> 02:47.091
Tokki, did you mess up the reservation?

02:47.257 --> 02:49.343
No. I made the right reservation.

02:49.510 --> 02:53.263
Oh, I mixed up four people and eight people.

02:53.430 --> 02:55.265
How can you mix that up?

02:55.432 --> 02:56.809
Sorry, sorry.

02:56.975 --> 02:58.811
I'll get another car.

02:58.977 --> 02:59.978
Another car?

03:00.562 --> 03:01.688
As an apology,

03:01.855 --> 03:05.734
I'm going to give you a convertible
with lots of room in the back seat!

03:05.901 --> 03:08.195
-Seriously?
-A convertible?

03:13.784 --> 03:15.869
-How is it?
-Well, there is lots of room.

03:16.036 --> 03:18.747
-It feels liberating.
-So, no problems.

03:18.914 --> 03:21.875
-No, no, no!
-Bring the car for eight people!

03:22.042 --> 03:24.294
We don't have big cars like that here.

03:24.461 --> 03:26.380
What's wrong with this shop?

03:26.547 --> 03:27.798
Have a nice trip!

03:27.965 --> 03:29.633
-What?
-Hey, old man!

03:29.800 --> 03:31.135
What are we going to do?

03:31.301 --> 03:32.761
This car is manual.

03:32.928 --> 03:36.056
-Sorry. I forgot to bring my license.
-Me too.

03:36.223 --> 03:38.600
I can only drive automatics.

03:49.486 --> 03:51.155
Life is short.

03:52.114 --> 03:54.658
The sky is so blue.

03:54.825 --> 03:56.702
You guys are so rude!

03:56.869 --> 03:59.621
Wow, this is a good ride!

03:59.788 --> 04:02.583
Hey! I forgot to tell you.

04:03.333 --> 04:06.712
The roads here are all on private land.

04:06.879 --> 04:09.673
This old guy really has some nerve.

04:09.840 --> 04:12.259
-Bye!
-Here we go!

04:12.426 --> 04:14.261
Everyone, hold on to something!

04:19.266 --> 04:22.519
Cakey is driving a manual?

04:22.686 --> 04:24.813
She's really used to it.

04:24.980 --> 04:26.648
How come you're so used to manuals?

04:26.815 --> 04:28.650
I'm not used to it!

04:28.817 --> 04:30.736
Well, this is amazing.

04:30.903 --> 04:32.571
No way!

04:32.738 --> 04:36.825
Are you trying to say that a city girl like me
drove a car to help out in rice fields?

04:36.992 --> 04:38.827
I see. So that's why.

04:38.994 --> 04:40.829
Then we have nothing to worry about.

